WEBVTT

00:02.480 --> 00:04.022
Water...

00:04.857 --> 00:06.108
Earth...

00:06.693 --> 00:07.985
Fire...

00:09.070 --> 00:10.320
Air...

00:11.072 --> 00:14.533
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.285 --> 00:18.787
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.622 --> 00:22.457
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:22.542 --> 00:23.667
could stop them.

00:23.751 --> 00:25.544
But when the world needed him most,

00:25.628 --> 00:26.795
he vanished.

00:27.255 --> 00:29.256
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I

00:29.340 --> 00:32.634
discovered the new Avatar,
an airbender named Aang.

00:32.969 --> 00:35.095
And although his airbending
skills were great,

00:35.179 --> 00:38.598
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

00:38.975 --> 00:42.102
But I believe Aang can save the world.

01:01.539 --> 01:03.999
Let's go, Appa! Come on, boy.

01:06.085 --> 01:08.211
Look, I'm sorry, but Katara and Sokka

01:08.296 --> 01:10.088
aren't coming
to the Fire Nation with us.

01:10.715 --> 01:13.258
If they got hurt,
I'd never forgive myself.

01:13.968 --> 01:16.303
So get your big butt
off the ground and let's go!

01:17.555 --> 01:18.889
Aah!

01:19.223 --> 01:20.223
I think his big butt

01:20.308 --> 01:21.391
is trying to tell you something.

01:21.768 --> 01:23.268
Please don't go, Aang.

01:23.353 --> 01:25.896
The world can't afford to lose you
to the Fire Nation.

01:26.397 --> 01:27.481
Neither can I.

01:32.820 --> 01:34.571
But I have to talk to Avatar Roku

01:34.655 --> 01:36.031
to find out what my vision means.

01:36.366 --> 01:38.158
I need to get to the fire temple

01:38.242 --> 01:39.868
before the sun sets on the solstice.

01:40.203 --> 01:41.328
That's today!

01:44.665 --> 01:47.542
We're not letting you
go into the Fire Nation, Aang.

01:48.419 --> 01:50.295
At least not without your friends.

01:50.380 --> 01:51.546
We got your back.

01:54.717 --> 01:55.759
Ew!

01:55.843 --> 01:58.220
It's a long journey
to the crescent island.

01:58.638 --> 02:00.389
You'll have to fly fast
to have any chance

02:00.473 --> 02:02.265
of making it before sundown.

02:02.892 --> 02:03.892
Good luck.

02:03.976 --> 02:04.976
Thank you for your--

02:05.061 --> 02:06.061
Go!

02:12.693 --> 02:13.902
Having trouble sleeping?

02:16.572 --> 02:18.240
Seen the Avatar lately?

02:27.250 --> 02:29.459
Come on, boy.
We've got a long way to go.

02:29.544 --> 02:30.544
Faster!

02:36.384 --> 02:38.927
Sailing into Fire Nation waters.

02:39.846 --> 02:41.805
Of all the foolish things you've done

02:41.889 --> 02:44.599
in your 16 years, Prince Zuko,

02:44.684 --> 02:47.310
this is the most foolish.

02:47.395 --> 02:48.854
I have no choice, uncle.

02:49.397 --> 02:51.022
Have you completely forgotten

02:51.107 --> 02:53.567
that the Fire Lord banished you?

02:54.068 --> 02:55.277
What if you're caught?

02:55.570 --> 02:57.279
I'm chasing the Avatar.

02:57.363 --> 02:59.239
My father will understand
why I'm returning home.

02:59.615 --> 03:01.825
You give him too much credit.

03:01.909 --> 03:04.536
My brother is not
the understanding type.

03:08.249 --> 03:09.624
There they are.

03:09.834 --> 03:11.543
Helmsman, full steam ahead.

03:13.546 --> 03:15.213
Aang, we got trouble.

03:15.298 --> 03:17.174
Yeah, and it's gaining fast!

03:24.599 --> 03:27.976
Really, Prince Zuko,
couldn't you shoot them down

03:28.060 --> 03:29.561
with something more fragrant?

03:32.857 --> 03:34.316
On my mark.

03:34.609 --> 03:35.609
Fire!

03:38.404 --> 03:39.863
Fire ball!

03:39.947 --> 03:40.947
I'm on it!

03:44.952 --> 03:46.786
We have to get out of Zuko's range

03:46.871 --> 03:49.122
before he shoots
another hotsticker at us!

03:49.332 --> 03:51.124
Can't you make Appa go any faster?

03:51.584 --> 03:53.919
Yeah, but there's
just one little problem.

03:54.545 --> 03:55.670
A blockade.

04:02.637 --> 04:03.970
Technically, you are still

04:04.055 --> 04:05.514
in Earth Kingdom waters.

04:05.598 --> 04:07.766
Turn back now,
and they cannot arrest you.

04:08.226 --> 04:09.226
If we fly north,

04:09.310 --> 04:10.810
we can go around the Fire Nation ships

04:10.895 --> 04:12.229
and avoid the blockade.

04:12.480 --> 04:13.688
It's the only way.

04:13.773 --> 04:15.398
There's no time!

04:15.483 --> 04:17.359
This is exactly why
I didn't want you to come.

04:17.443 --> 04:18.944
It's too dangerous.

04:19.028 --> 04:20.779
And that's exactly why we're here.

04:20.863 --> 04:22.614
Let's run this blockade.

04:23.407 --> 04:24.574
Appa, yip yip!

04:27.411 --> 04:28.703
He's not turning around.

04:28.788 --> 04:32.374
Please, Prince Zuko.
If the Fire Nation captures you,

04:32.458 --> 04:34.376
There is nothing I can do.

04:34.460 --> 04:36.545
Do not follow the Avatar.

04:37.171 --> 04:38.421
I'm sorry, uncle.

04:39.257 --> 04:40.840
Run the blockade!

04:41.676 --> 04:43.426
The Avatar...

04:44.136 --> 04:46.346
And the banished prince.

04:46.931 --> 04:49.474
This must be my lucky day.

04:49.559 --> 04:51.851
Commander Zhao, what are your orders?

04:51.936 --> 04:54.062
Shoot the bison down, captain.

04:54.146 --> 04:57.107
But there's a fire navy ship
out there, sir-- One of our own.

04:57.191 --> 04:58.233
What if it's hit?

04:58.317 --> 05:00.860
So be it. It belongs to a traitor.

05:01.404 --> 05:02.404
Ignite!

05:05.908 --> 05:06.908
Launch!

05:10.955 --> 05:12.289
Aah! Aah! Aah!

05:29.223 --> 05:30.557
Appa, are you ok?

05:44.989 --> 05:47.240
Prince Zuko, the engines are damaged!

05:47.325 --> 05:49.534
We need to stop and make repairs!

05:49.869 --> 05:51.661
Do not stop this ship.

05:52.204 --> 05:53.204
Launch!

05:58.711 --> 06:01.004
Aah!

06:08.679 --> 06:11.056
Aah! Aah! Aah!

06:12.183 --> 06:13.350
Aah!

06:14.310 --> 06:16.478
Sokka!

06:18.689 --> 06:23.360
Aah!

06:38.167 --> 06:39.334
Ready.

06:44.131 --> 06:45.131
Fire!

06:48.177 --> 06:49.803
Aah!

06:58.479 --> 07:00.563
Aah! Ooh!

07:06.946 --> 07:08.029
We made it!

07:08.114 --> 07:10.907
We got into the Fire Nation. Great.

07:11.492 --> 07:13.535
Where do you think
the Avatar is headed, sir?

07:13.619 --> 07:15.537
I'm not sure,

07:15.621 --> 07:18.248
but I bet a certain
banished prince will know.

07:21.127 --> 07:22.627
We're on a collision course!

07:22.712 --> 07:23.878
We can make it.

07:24.380 --> 07:27.257
The boarding party is ready
to apprehend Prince Zuko, sir.

07:27.633 --> 07:29.551
Wait. Cut the engines

07:29.635 --> 07:30.844
and let them pass.

07:30.928 --> 07:31.928
Sir?

07:53.951 --> 07:54.951
There it is--

07:55.661 --> 07:57.704
The island
where Roku's dragon took me.

08:03.210 --> 08:05.336
You did it, buddy. Nice flying.

08:06.881 --> 08:08.923
You must be tired.

08:09.008 --> 08:14.804
No, I'm good. Refreshed and ready
to fight some firebenders.

08:14.889 --> 08:16.765
I was talking to Appa.

08:17.349 --> 08:19.559
Well, I was talking to Momo.

08:27.526 --> 08:28.985
I don't see any guards.

08:29.069 --> 08:30.069
The Fire Nation

08:30.154 --> 08:31.196
must have abandoned the temple

08:31.280 --> 08:32.614
when Avatar Roku died.

08:32.907 --> 08:34.949
It's almost sundown.
We'd better hurry.

08:44.877 --> 08:47.670
Wait. I think I heard something.

08:48.714 --> 08:54.719
We are the fire sages,
guardians of the temple of the Avatar.

08:55.179 --> 08:56.888
Great. I am the Avatar.

08:57.473 --> 08:58.473
We know.

09:04.563 --> 09:06.064
I'll hold them off. Run!

09:10.903 --> 09:13.404
If the Avatar contacts Roku,

09:13.489 --> 09:15.865
there's no telling how powerful
the boy will become.

09:15.950 --> 09:17.700
Split up and find him.

09:21.622 --> 09:22.622
Follow me!

09:22.706 --> 09:23.748
Do you know where you're going?

09:24.041 --> 09:25.041
Nope.

09:26.752 --> 09:28.211
Wrong way!

09:28.838 --> 09:29.921
Come back!

09:35.845 --> 09:38.763
I don't want to fight you.
I am a friend.

09:39.265 --> 09:41.057
Firebenders aren't our friends.

09:43.894 --> 09:46.062
I know why you're here, Avatar.

09:46.146 --> 09:47.272
You do?

09:47.356 --> 09:50.650
Yes. You wish to speak to Avatar Roku.

09:51.318 --> 09:52.861
I can take you to him.

09:52.945 --> 09:53.945
How?

09:59.660 --> 10:00.660
This way.

10:01.453 --> 10:02.453
Find him!

10:03.873 --> 10:05.456
Time is running out! Quickly!

10:14.425 --> 10:16.092
What's he up to, uncle?

10:16.176 --> 10:18.219
Why didn't Commander Zhao arrest me?

10:18.304 --> 10:20.680
Because he wants to follow you.

10:20.764 --> 10:22.098
He knows you'll lead him

10:22.182 --> 10:24.392
to the prize you're both after--

10:24.476 --> 10:25.602
The Avatar.

10:26.312 --> 10:28.313
If Zhao wants to follow
our trail of smoke,

10:28.397 --> 10:30.607
then that's exactly
what I'll let him do.

10:31.400 --> 10:34.027
Avatar Roku once called
this temple his home.

10:34.528 --> 10:37.614
He formed these secret passages
out of the magma.

10:37.698 --> 10:39.490
Did you know Avatar Roku?

10:39.575 --> 10:42.201
No, but my grandfather knew him.

10:42.828 --> 10:44.662
Many generations of fire sages

10:44.747 --> 10:47.332
guarded this temple long before me.

10:47.416 --> 10:49.542
We all have a strong
spiritual connection

10:49.627 --> 10:51.044
to this place.

10:51.128 --> 10:52.587
Is that how you knew I was coming?

10:52.963 --> 10:56.049
A few weeks ago,
an amazing thing occurred.

10:56.133 --> 10:58.259
The statue of Avatar Roku--

10:58.886 --> 11:00.678
Its eyes began to glow.

11:00.763 --> 11:02.680
That's when we were
at the air temple.

11:02.765 --> 11:05.391
Avatar Roku's eyes
were glowing there, too.

11:05.476 --> 11:09.145
At that moment,
we knew you had returned to the world.

11:09.688 --> 11:11.648
If this is the Avatar's temple,

11:11.732 --> 11:13.399
why did the sages attack me?

11:13.484 --> 11:15.234
Things have changed.

11:15.319 --> 11:16.945
In the past, the sages were loyal

11:17.029 --> 11:18.655
only to the Avatar.

11:19.198 --> 11:23.952
When Roku died, the sages eagerly
awaited for the next Avatar to return,

11:24.370 --> 11:25.828
but he never came.

11:26.246 --> 11:27.789
They were waiting for me.

11:27.873 --> 11:30.583
Hey, don't feel bad.
You're only 100 years late.

11:31.001 --> 11:33.544
They lost hope that the Avatar
would ever return.

11:33.963 --> 11:36.631
When Fire Lord Sozin began the war,

11:36.715 --> 11:38.633
my grandfather and the other sages

11:38.717 --> 11:40.885
were forced to follow him.

11:40.970 --> 11:43.680
I never wanted to serve the Fire Lord.

11:44.306 --> 11:46.057
When I learned you were coming,

11:46.141 --> 11:48.559
I knew I would have to
betray the other sages.

11:48.978 --> 11:50.186
Thank you for helping me.

11:52.648 --> 11:54.482
We'll follow these stairs
to the sanctuary.

11:55.401 --> 11:56.901
Once you're inside,

11:56.986 --> 11:59.904
wait for the light to hit
Avatar Roku's statue.

12:00.239 --> 12:02.699
Only then will you be
able to speak with him.

12:11.792 --> 12:12.792
No!

12:13.460 --> 12:15.169
Shyu, what's wrong?

12:15.462 --> 12:18.381
The sanctuary doors-- They're closed.

12:18.465 --> 12:20.675
Can't you just open them
with firebending,

12:20.759 --> 12:22.218
like you opened that other door?

12:22.636 --> 12:26.055
No. Only a fully realized Avatar

12:26.140 --> 12:28.516
is powerful enough
to open this door alone.

12:29.018 --> 12:31.936
Otherwise, the sages must
open the doors together

12:32.271 --> 12:35.314
with five simultaneous fire blasts.

12:35.733 --> 12:37.400
Five fire blasts?

12:38.777 --> 12:40.236
I think I can help you out.

12:42.906 --> 12:44.449
Uncle, keep heading north.

12:44.825 --> 12:46.325
Zhao will follow the smoke trail

12:46.410 --> 12:47.994
while I use it as a cover.

12:57.838 --> 12:58.838
This is a little trick

12:58.922 --> 13:00.256
I picked up from my father.

13:00.591 --> 13:03.634
I seal the lamp oil inside
an animal skin casing.

13:04.053 --> 13:05.928
Shyu lights the oil-soaked twine,

13:06.013 --> 13:07.096
and ta da!

13:07.181 --> 13:08.556
Fake firebending.

13:09.058 --> 13:11.184
You're really outdone yourself
this time, Sokka.

13:11.268 --> 13:13.269
This might actually work.

13:16.148 --> 13:17.690
The sages will hear the explosion,

13:17.775 --> 13:19.776
so as soon as they go off,
you rush in.

13:22.529 --> 13:24.530
It's almost sunset. Are you ready?

13:24.615 --> 13:25.698
Definitely.

13:34.249 --> 13:35.249
Ooh!

13:41.673 --> 13:42.715
They're still locked!

13:46.512 --> 13:48.179
It didn't work.

13:58.232 --> 14:02.193
Why won't it open?!!

14:02.945 --> 14:04.654
Aang, stop.

14:04.988 --> 14:06.489
There's nothing else we can do.

14:06.573 --> 14:09.534
I'm sorry I put you
through all this for nothing.

14:09.618 --> 14:10.701
I don't get it.

14:11.286 --> 14:12.662
That blast looked as strong

14:12.746 --> 14:14.288
as any firebending I've seen.

14:15.207 --> 14:17.625
Sokka, you're a genius!

14:17.709 --> 14:19.627
Wait. How is Sokka a genius?

14:19.711 --> 14:21.045
His plan didn't even work.

14:21.547 --> 14:23.589
Come on, Aang. Let her dream.

14:24.133 --> 14:27.218
You're right.
Sokka's plan didn't work,

14:27.302 --> 14:29.387
but it looks like it did.

14:29.638 --> 14:31.222
Did the definition of genius change

14:31.306 --> 14:32.932
in the last 100 years?

14:33.851 --> 14:36.644
Come quickly!
The Avatar has entered the sanctuary!

14:36.728 --> 14:38.020
How did he get in?

14:38.105 --> 14:40.606
I know, but look at the scorch marks,

14:40.691 --> 14:41.691
and down there.

14:43.777 --> 14:47.029
He's inside.
Open the doors immediately

14:47.406 --> 14:50.449
before he contacts Avatar Roku.

15:04.882 --> 15:06.424
It's the Avatar's lemur.

15:06.717 --> 15:08.843
He must have crawled
through the pipes.

15:08.927 --> 15:10.136
We've been tricked!

15:10.220 --> 15:11.304
Aah!

15:14.558 --> 15:15.558
Now, Aang.

15:17.352 --> 15:18.853
Aang, now's your chance!

15:21.231 --> 15:23.232
The Avatar's coming with me.

15:28.030 --> 15:29.655
Close the doors, quickly!

15:35.204 --> 15:36.787
Aah!

15:37.497 --> 15:38.497
Go!

15:45.881 --> 15:46.881
He made it!

15:59.770 --> 16:02.271
The light hits the statue,
and I talk to Roku.

16:02.356 --> 16:03.856
So why isn't anything happening?

16:09.488 --> 16:11.781
Why isn't it working?
It's sealed shut.

16:11.865 --> 16:13.616
It must have been the light.

16:13.700 --> 16:16.285
Avatar Roku doesn't want us inside.

16:19.039 --> 16:20.873
Why isn't anything happening?

16:21.583 --> 16:23.000
I don't know what I'm doing.

16:23.085 --> 16:24.543
All I know is airbending.

16:24.628 --> 16:26.629
Please, Avatar Roku, talk to me.

16:34.513 --> 16:36.555
It's good to see you, Aang.

16:37.224 --> 16:39.141
What took you so long?

16:43.855 --> 16:45.606
Why did you help the Avatar?

16:45.691 --> 16:48.401
Because it was once the sage's duty.

16:48.902 --> 16:51.445
It is still our duty.

16:55.242 --> 16:58.536
What a moving
and heartfelt performance.

16:59.371 --> 17:01.789
I'm certain the Fire Lord
will understand

17:01.873 --> 17:04.625
when you explain why you betrayed him.

17:04.710 --> 17:05.960
Commander Zhao--

17:06.545 --> 17:08.045
And, Prince Zuko,

17:08.130 --> 17:10.256
it was a noble effort,

17:10.340 --> 17:13.342
but your little smokescreen
didn't work.

17:13.677 --> 17:16.220
Two traitors in one day.

17:16.305 --> 17:18.347
The Fire Lord will be pleased.

17:18.640 --> 17:20.141
You're too late, Zhao.

17:20.225 --> 17:21.600
The Avatar's inside,

17:21.685 --> 17:22.685
and the doors are sealed.

17:23.061 --> 17:25.771
No matter. Sooner or later,

17:25.856 --> 17:27.481
he has to come out.

17:31.445 --> 17:35.281
I have something very important
to tell you, Aang.

17:35.615 --> 17:39.869
That is why,
when you were in the spirit world,

17:39.953 --> 17:42.204
I sent my dragon to find you.

17:42.581 --> 17:44.040
Is it about that vision--

17:44.124 --> 17:45.124
The one of the comet?

17:45.375 --> 17:46.459
Yes.

17:46.543 --> 17:47.668
What does it mean?

17:47.961 --> 17:50.046
100 years ago,

17:50.130 --> 17:52.423
Fire Lord Sozin used that comet

17:52.507 --> 17:54.175
to begin the war.

17:54.259 --> 17:56.719
He and his firebending army

17:56.803 --> 17:59.055
harnessed its incredible power

17:59.139 --> 18:01.057
and dealt a deadly first strike

18:01.141 --> 18:03.142
against the other nations.

18:03.226 --> 18:05.269
So the comet made them stronger?

18:05.687 --> 18:09.398
Yes, stronger than you
could even imagine.

18:09.608 --> 18:11.442
But that happened a hundred years ago.

18:11.526 --> 18:13.736
What does the comet
have to do with the war now?

18:13.820 --> 18:15.154
Listen carefully.

18:15.906 --> 18:19.200
Sozin's Comet will return
by the end of this summer,

18:19.284 --> 18:21.869
and Fire Lord Ozai will use its power

18:21.953 --> 18:24.789
to finish the war once and for all.

18:24.873 --> 18:26.582
Aah!

18:27.334 --> 18:29.919
If he succeeds, even the Avatar

18:30.003 --> 18:32.922
won't be able to restore
balance to the world.

18:33.006 --> 18:36.550
Aang, you must defeat the Fire Lord

18:36.635 --> 18:38.594
before the comet arrives.

18:39.054 --> 18:41.055
But I haven't even started
learning waterbending,

18:41.139 --> 18:43.057
not to mention earth and fire.

18:43.141 --> 18:47.269
Mastering the elements takes years
of discipline and practice,

18:47.604 --> 18:49.814
But if the world is to survive,

18:49.898 --> 18:52.608
you must do it by summer's end.

19:00.575 --> 19:02.410
When those doors open,

19:02.494 --> 19:04.829
unleash all your firepower.

19:05.247 --> 19:07.081
How's Aang gonna make it out of this?

19:07.165 --> 19:08.499
How are we gonna make it out of this?

19:11.711 --> 19:13.921
What if I can't master
all the elements in time?

19:14.005 --> 19:15.172
What if I fail?

19:15.257 --> 19:17.299
I know you can do it, Aang,

19:17.717 --> 19:20.719
for you have done it before.

19:21.096 --> 19:23.347
The solstice is ending.

19:23.432 --> 19:27.852
We must go our separate ways for now.

19:27.936 --> 19:29.979
But I won't be able
to come back to the temple.

19:30.355 --> 19:31.856
What if I have questions?

19:31.940 --> 19:33.065
How will I talk to you?

19:33.442 --> 19:35.943
I am a part of you.

19:36.027 --> 19:38.904
When you need to talk to me again,

19:38.989 --> 19:41.198
you will find a way.

19:43.201 --> 19:46.412
A great danger awaits you
at the temple.

19:47.289 --> 19:49.707
I can help you face the threat,

19:49.791 --> 19:51.417
But only if you are ready.

19:53.670 --> 19:54.670
I'm ready.

20:05.348 --> 20:06.640
Ready...

20:07.976 --> 20:09.393
No! Aang!

20:09.936 --> 20:10.936
Fire!

20:17.652 --> 20:18.944
Avatar Roku!

20:31.541 --> 20:33.459
Avatar Roku is going to
destroy the temple.

20:33.543 --> 20:34.919
We have to get out of here!

20:35.003 --> 20:36.253
Not without Aang!

21:07.035 --> 21:08.285
We got your back.

21:08.703 --> 21:10.538
Thanks. Where's Shyu?

21:10.622 --> 21:11.622
I don't know.

21:37.482 --> 21:40.234
No prince, no Avatar.

21:40.360 --> 21:42.444
Apparently the only thing I do have

21:42.696 --> 21:44.280
is five traitors.

21:44.364 --> 21:47.032
But, Commander,
only Shyu helped the Avatar.

21:47.200 --> 21:49.410
Save your stories for the Fire Lord.

21:49.703 --> 21:51.412
As far as I'm concerned,

21:51.496 --> 21:53.372
you are all guilty.

21:53.665 --> 21:55.124
Take them to the prison hold!
